 "offset_seconds": -2.4000000000002046,
 "words_heard": 215,
 "words": 219,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "A conspiracy formed in the city gate",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Amaziah fled to Lachish in fear",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They sent men after him to that place",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Killing the king who had reigned so long",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They brought him back on horses home",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Buried in the City of David",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Among his fathers in the sacred ground",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The people gathered in the streets",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Took the young prince from the royal house",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Sixteen years old upon the throne",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In place of his father who is gone",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Azariah rules the land of Judah",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "His mother's name was Jecoliah",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A woman of Jerusalem",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "She stood in the shadow of kings",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.11,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Her name recorded in the chronicles",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Uzziah was sixteen years old",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When he became king in Jerusalem",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He reigned fifty-two years there",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Seeking the Lord with all his heart",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He rebuilt Eloth for Judah",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "After the king rested with fathers",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He did what was right in God's eyes",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Just as his father Amaziah did",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "His mother's name was Jecoliah",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A woman of Jerusalem",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "She stood in the shadow of kings",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Her name recorded in the chronicles",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He set himself to seek God",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In the days of Zechariah's visions",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "As long as he sought the Lord",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "God gave him success and strength",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Jecoliah of Jerusalem",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Mother of the faithful king",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Her name lives in the scripture",
